<title>FRANCE: Gle des Eaux Havas likely to be suspended.</title>
<headline>Gle des Eaux Havas likely to be suspended.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share trading in Generale des Eaux and Havas is likely to be suspended on Monday pending a statement, with the former set to boost its stake in Havas in exchange for moving to Havas a 20 percent stake in pay TV firm Canal Plus, French newspapers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The papers said Generale des Eaux was also set to buy about half of a 21.2 percent stake in Canal Plus from Alcatel Alsthom.  </p>
<p>Le Figaro said the deal would up Havas's stake in Canal Plus without forcing it to launch a takeover bid.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
